3. STATEMENT OF MODIFICATIONS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository makes NO modifications to any bundled source or binary. Files are
byte-for-byte as produced by the upstream CARLA 0.9.16 build; even the upstream
filename typo include/carla/client/FIleTransfer.cpp is preserved. No file has
been reformatted, re-headered, or patched here.

One bundled file was modified upstream, by CARLA rather than by this repository,
and says so in its own header:

  include/moodycamel/ConcurrentQueue.h
    "Notice: This file has been slightly adapted for its use by CARLA."

That notice is retained in the file, as BSD-2-Clause requires.


